      "complexity": "simple",
      "summary": "UnifiedMemoryManager 的伴生对象，包含 RESERVED_SYSTEM_MEMORY_BYTES 常量（300MB）、apply 工厂方法（从 SparkConf 构造实例）和 getMaxMemory 私有方法（计算可共享内存总量）。",
      "tags": ["companion-object", "factory", "configuration"]
    },

    {
      "id": "concept:unified-memory-soft-boundary",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "统一内存软边界 (Unified Memory Soft Boundary)",
      "summary": "Spark 1.6+ 的核心策略：执行和存储共享一块总内存（默认 = (JVM堆 - 300MB) × 0.6），任一方可借用另一方的空闲空间；当执行需要回收空间时，存储的缓存块被驱逐。",
      "tags": ["policy", "soft-boundary", "borrowing", "eviction"]
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:task-fair-sharing",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "任务公平共享 (Task Fair Sharing)",
      "summary": "ExecutionMemoryPool 的核心算法：保证每个任务至少能获得 1/(2N) 的执行内存（N=活动任务数），上限为 1/N。新任务通过 lock.wait() 阻塞，旧任务释放时 lock.notifyAll() 唤醒。",
      "tags": ["fairness", "algorithm", "wait-notify", "spill-prevention"]
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:tungsten-memory-mode",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "Tungsten 内存模式",
      "summary": "Spark 的二进制内存管理优化：根据 spark.memory.offHeap.enabled 决定使用堆内 ON_HEAP 分配或 sun.misc.Unsafe 实现的堆外 OFF_HEAP 分配；通过 MemoryAllocator 抽象。",
      "tags": ["tungsten", "off-heap", "unsafe", "binary-memory"]
    },

    {
