      "complexity": "simple",
      "summary": "将池大小增加 delta 字节，断言 delta >= 0，final 不可重写。",
      "tags": ["mutator", "synchronized", "final"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/MemoryPool.scala:MemoryPool.decrementPoolSize",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "decrementPoolSize",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/MemoryPool.scala",
      "complexity": "simple",
      "summary": "将池大小减少 delta 字节；断言 delta >= 0、delta <= _poolSize 且释放后仍能容纳 memoryUsed。",
      "tags": ["mutator", "synchronized", "final", "assertion"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/ExecutionMemoryPool.scala:ExecutionMemoryPool.acquireMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquireMemory",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/ExecutionMemoryPool.scala",
      "complexity": "complex",
      "summary": "为指定任务申请 numBytes 字节，可能阻塞；通过 maybeGrowPool 回调尝试扩展池大小，通过 computeMaxPoolSize 回调计算最大池大小作为任务配额分母。返回实际授予的字节数。",
      "tags": ["allocation", "blocking", "fairness", "callback"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/ExecutionMemoryPool.scala:ExecutionMemoryPool.releaseMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "releaseMemory",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/ExecutionMemoryPool.scala",
      "complexity": "simple",
      "summary": "释放指定任务占用的 numBytes 字节；若任务内存归零则从 memoryForTask 中移除并通过 notifyAll 唤醒等待者。",
      "tags": ["deallocation", "synchronized", "notify"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/ExecutionMemoryPool.scala:ExecutionMemoryPool.releaseAllMemoryForTask",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "releaseAllMemoryForTask",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/ExecutionMemoryPool.scala",
      "complexity": "simple",
      "summary": "释放指定任务的所有内存（任务结束时调用），返回释放的字节数。",
      "tags": ["deallocation", "task-end", "synchronized"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/StorageMemoryPool.scala:StorageMemoryPool.acquireMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquireMemory (StorageMemoryPool)",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/StorageMemoryPool.scala",
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "summary": "为给定 blockId 申请 numBytesToAcquire 字节的存储内存；先调用 MemoryStore.evictBlocksToFreeSpace 驱逐已缓存块以腾出 numBytesToFree 空间，更新 _memoryUsed 并返回是否成功。",
      "tags": ["allocation", "eviction", "synchronized", "block-caching"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/StorageMemoryPool.scala:StorageMemoryPool.freeSpaceToShrinkPool",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "freeSpaceToShrinkPool",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/StorageMemoryPool.scala",
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "summary": "释放 spaceToFree 字节：先释放空闲内存，若不够则通过 MemoryStore 驱逐块；返回实际释放字节数。注意：本方法不实际缩减池大小，由调用者负责调用 decrementPoolSize。",
      "tags": ["shrink", "eviction", "delegation", "memorystore"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/MemoryManager.scala:MemoryManager.acquireStorageMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquireStorageMemory",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/MemoryManager.scala",
      "complexity": "complex",
      "summary": "抽象方法：申请 numBytes 字节的存储内存以缓存给定 blockId，必要时驱逐现有块；返回是否成功。UnifiedMemoryManager 实现了此方法。",
      "tags": ["abstract", "storage-allocation", "eviction"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/MemoryManager.scala:MemoryManager.acquireExecutionMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquireExecutionMemory",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/MemoryManager.scala",
      "complexity": "complex",
      "summary": "为当前任务申请 numBytes 字节执行内存；可能阻塞直到能获得至少 1/(2N)。由 ExecutionMemoryPool.acquireMemory 实现具体逻辑。",
      "tags": ["abstract-via-pool", "execution-allocation", "blocking"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala:UnifiedMemoryManager.acquireExecutionMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquireExecutionMemory (override)",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala",
      "complexity": "complex",
      "summary": "重写自 MemoryManager：通过 maybeGrowExecutionPool 回调让执行池可通过驱逐存储块来扩张（shrink storage pool、grow execution pool），并通过 computeMaxExecutionPoolSize 计算合理的任务配额上界以避免 SPARK-12155。",
      "tags": ["override", "borrowing", "eviction", "spark-12155"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala:UnifiedMemoryManager.acquireStorageMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquireStorageMemory (override)",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala",
      "complexity": "complex",
      "summary": "重写自 MemoryManager：存储池空闲时直接分配，否则从执行池借用空闲空间（但不会驱逐已使用的执行内存）。",
      "tags": ["override", "borrowing", "no-evict-of-execution"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala:UnifiedMemoryManager$.getMaxMemory",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "getMaxMemory",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala",
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "summary": "私有静态方法：根据 SparkConf 计算执行和存储可共享的总内存（(systemMemory - reservedMemory) * memoryFraction）；校验系统内存不低于 reservedMemory * 1.5，并校验 executor 内存下限。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "validation", "static"]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala:UnifiedMemoryManager$.apply",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "apply (UnifiedMemoryManager)",
      "filePath": "core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/memory/UnifiedMemoryManager.scala",
      "complexity": "simple",
      "summary": "伴生对象的工厂方法：从 SparkConf 和 numCores 构造 UnifiedMemoryManager 实例，先计算 maxMemory 再用 storageFraction 计算 onHeapStorageRegionSize。",
      "tags": ["factory", "configuration"]
    }
